# Colours for treeleaf.obj.
#
# Every channel is a multiple of 0x11, because the panel is four bits per
# channel and a colour that is not shifts on the device and nowhere else.
#
# A lighter, yellower green than the conifer, which is the only thing telling
# the two species apart once the silhouette is eight pixels tall.

newmtl leaf_canopy
Kd 0.400000 0.733333 0.333333   # #66BB55

newmtl leaf_bark
Kd 0.466667 0.333333 0.200000   # #775533
